 Briarhelm (Head 201)]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s36_2516\",\"timestamp\":1774803808},{\"recordedBy\":\"Strathmoan-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valeera Sanguinar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Valeera Sanguinar begins making a campfire.\",\"timestamp\":1774826092,\"id\":\"s36_2517\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Strathmoan-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"University Undergraduate\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"University Undergraduate says: Something is not right? You were speaking with those monsters!\",\"timestamp\":1774826115,\"id\":\"s36_2518\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Strathmoan-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valeera Sanguinar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Valeera Sanguinar says: Gather yourself.\",\"timestamp\":1774826118,\"id\":\"s36_2519\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Strathmoan-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valeera Sanguinar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Valeera Sanguinar says: Your life is mine.\",\"timestamp\":1774826118,\"id\":\"s36_2520\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Strathmoan-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valeera Sanguinar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Valeera Sanguinar says: Won't see me coming.\",\"timestamp\":1774826120,\"id\":\"s36_2521\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Strathmoan-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valeera Sanguinar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Valeera Sanguinar says: My eye's on 