_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Skyguard Marine says: For the Alliance!\",\"timestamp\":1775000282,\"id\":\"s39_3235\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Strathmoan-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Skyguard Marine\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Skyguard Marine says: For the Alliance!\",\"timestamp\":1775000292,\"id\":\"s39_3236\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Strathmoan-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_BG_SYSTEM_NEUTRAL\",\"type\":\"BG_NEUTRAL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.4705882668495178,\"b\":0.03921568766236305},\"text\":\"The battle begins in 30 seconds!\",\"timestamp\":1775000299,\"id\":\"s39_3237\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Strathmoan-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Master Mathias Shaw\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Master Mathias Shaw says: Champions, Azerite deposits have been located on an island off the coast of Feralas. We must secure them before the Horde does.\",\"timestamp\":1775000300,\"id\":\"s39_3238\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Strathmoan-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Skyguard Marine\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Skyguard Marine says: For the Alliance!\",\"timestamp\":1775000307,\"id\":\"s39_3239\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Strathmoan-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Master Mathias Shaw\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Master Mathias Shaw says: We've brought our ship around to the center of the island. Collect as much Azerite as you can. It is the key to victory!\",\"timestamp\":1775000309,\"id\":\"s39_3240\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Strathmoan-Tichondrius\",\"typeInf