,\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Amarakk says: The Pit attracts many threats. See that they do not spill out.\",\"id\":\"s39_3430\",\"timestamp\":1775002211},{\"recordedBy\":\"Strathmoan-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"name\":\"Strathmoan\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"As you step inside, drawn ever closer to hidden treasure, your Coffer Key Shards stir as if awakened by the promise of riches. They shimmer, then fuse together, becoming whole once more.\",\"id\":\"s39_3431\",\"timestamp\":1775002250},{\"recordedBy\":\"Strathmoan-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ4:|T4622270:12|t|Hcurrency:3028:0|h[Restored Coffer Key]|h|rx4\",\"id\":\"s39_3432\",\"timestamp\":1775002250},{\"recordedBy\":\"Strathmoan-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valeera Sanguinar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Valeera Sanguinar begins making a campfire.\",\"id\":\"s39_3433\",\"timestamp\":1775002252},{\"recordedBy\":\"Strathmoan-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Boletus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Boletus yells: Strathmoan, help! This not scheduled fight!\",\"id\":\"s39_3434\",\"timestamp\":1775002253},{\"recordedBy\":\"Strathmoan-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valeera Sanguinar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Valeera Sanguinar says: Lightbloom capt