"|Hplayer:Adeptz-Area52|h[|cffffffffAdeptz-Area52|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:5228:Player-3676-09F6CB4F:1:4:8:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Wild Hammering]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s44_2613\",\"timestamp\":1775700940},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Xal'atath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Xal'atath yells: Ah, and my favorite champions as well! I was afraid you might miss this.\",\"id\":\"s44_2614\",\"timestamp\":1775700941},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: After what happened with Turalyon and Arator... I can see how Alleria would struggle to maintain control. I doubt I'd be able to, if it were me.\",\"id\":\"s44_2615\",\"timestamp\":1775700944},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alleria Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alleria Windrunner grimaces in pain.\",\"id\":\"s44_2616\",\"timestamp\":1775700950},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator yells: What are you doing to her?!\",\"id\":\"s44_2617\",\"timestamp\":1775700951},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Xal'atath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Xal'atath yells: Keeping my promise, of course. Taking everything she loves. Leaving her with nothing but the Void.\",\"id\":\"s44_2618\",\"timestamp\":1775700952},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: Still, should Xal'atath succeed, and Alleria loses her grip on the dark naaru within her... I fear all may be lost.\",\"id\":\"s44_2619\",\"timestamp\":1775700955},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator yells: No!\",\"id\":\"s44_2620\",\"timestamp\":1775700961},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Troll\",\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"name\":\"Brainhaze-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Brainhaze-Tichondrius|h[|cffc69b6dBrainhaze|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62288:Player-11-0EB21A80:1:4:8:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong Woods: The Highest Peaks]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s44_2621\",\"timestamp\":1775700965},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Troll\",\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"name\":\"Brainhaze-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Brainhaze-Tichondrius|h[|cffc69b6dBrainhaze|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:62057:Player-11-0EB21A80:1:4:8:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight: The Highest Peaks]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s44_2622\",\"timestamp\":1775700965},{\"recordedBy\":\