efore they hatch anew!\",\"id\":\"s44_2792\",\"timestamp\":1775703639},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator yells: Two halves of a whole--Vereesa, follow the Light phoenix. I'll take the other side.\",\"id\":\"s44_2793\",\"timestamp\":1775703648},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vereesa Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vereesa Windrunner yells: Are you sure?\",\"id\":\"s44_2794\",\"timestamp\":1775703654},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator yells: I know what the Void can do. I can handle this.\",\"id\":\"s44_2795\",\"timestamp\":1775703656},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Delibash-Mal'Ganis\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Delibash-Mal'Ganis receives loot: |cnIQ0:|T132838:12|t|Hitem:260650::::::::90:1480:::::::::|h[Elemental Debris]|h|r.\",\"id\":\"s44_2796\",\"timestamp\":1775703680},{\"recordedBy\":\"Starphage-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Smileclap-Mal'Ganis\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"Smileclap-Mal'Ganis receives loot: |cnIQ0:|T237286:12|t|Hitem:260638::::::::90:1480:::::::::|h[Fine Void Residue]|h|rx2.\",\"id\":\"s44_2797\",\"timestamp\":1775703681},{\"recordedBy\"