"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ethereal Warpweaver says: Please state the nature of the stylistic emergency.\",\"id\":\"s44_3078\",\"timestamp\":1775741865},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Gnome\",\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"name\":\"Coreydk-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Coreydk-Tichondrius|h[|cffc41e3aCoreydk|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:42767:Player-11-0E7F21FB:1:4:9:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Veteran of the Dawn]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s44_3079\",\"timestamp\":1775742152},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: Despite our long history of animosity, we elves have proven that together we are greater than our grievances.\",\"id\":\"s44_3080\",\"timestamp\":1775742161},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: Perhaps the rifts between us will never fully heal. But we must at least attempt to bridge them.\",\"id\":\"s44_3081\",\"timestamp\":1775742170},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Vulpera\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Arisol-Blackrock\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Arisol-Blackrock|h[|cff0070ddArisol-Blackrock|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61863:Player-121-0AE