s: My old harmonial... You kept it?\",\"timestamp\":1776189604,\"id\":\"s45_3365\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: Wait... Does this mean what I think it means?\",\"timestamp\":1776189608,\"id\":\"s45_3366\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: That desk was a menace. It kept eating magic items we left on it.\",\"timestamp\":1776189609,\"id\":\"s45_3367\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: Well... a lot of work went into it and you did earn it.\",\"timestamp\":1776189611,\"id\":\"s45_3368\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: To show our gratitude for your aid, we... I... am awarding you this property as an embassy for the ren'dorei.\",\"timestamp\":1776189615,\"id\":\"s45_3369\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|T7639517:12|t|Hcurrency:3391:0|h[Adventurer Dawncrest]|h|rx10\",\"timestamp\":1776189616,\"id\":\"s45_3370\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_BG_SYSTEM_NEUTRAL\",\"type\":\"BG_NEUTRAL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.4705882668495178,\"b\":0.03921568766236305},\"text\":\"Someone has indicated they are ready for the match to start!\",\"timestamp\":1776189620,\"id\":\"s45_3371\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_INSTANCE_CHAT\",\"type\":\"INSTANCE_CHAT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.4980392456054688,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:INSTANCE_CHAT|h[Instance]|h |Hplayer:Stormclout-Tichondrius:1417:INSTANCE_CHAT:|h[|cff00ff98Stormclout|r]|h: full send dk\",\"timestamp\":1776189640,\"id\":\"s45_3372\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_BG_SYSTEM_NEUTRAL\",\"type\":\"BG_NEUTRAL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.4705882668495178,\"b\":0.03921568766236305},\"text\":\"Thirty seconds until the Arena battle begins!\",\"timestamp\":1776189645,\"id\":\"s45_3373\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_BG_SYSTEM_NEUTRAL\",\"type\":\"BG_NEUTRAL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.4705882668495178,\"b\":0.03921568766236305},\"text\":\"Fifteen seconds until the Arena battle begins!\",\"timestamp\":1776189660,\"id\":\"s45_3374\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PING\",\"type\":\"PING\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.6666666865348816,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Stormclout|h[Stormclout]: |h|A:ping_chat_nonthreat:0:0:0:0|aItsjango\",\"timestamp\":1776189674,\"id\":\"s45_3375\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_BG_SYSTEM_NEUTRAL\",\"type\":\"BG_NEUTRAL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.4705882668495178,\"b\":0.03921568766236305},\"text\":\"The Arena battle has begun!\",\"timestamp\":1776189674,\"id\":\"s45_3376\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|T1455894:12|t|Hcurrency:1792:0|h[Honor]|h|rx52\",\"timestamp\":1776189721,\"id\":\"s45_3377\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Archmage Aethas Sunreaver\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Archmage Aethas Sunreaver says: Vereesa and I have decided that our people can no longer afford to fight each other.\",\"timestamp\":1776189756,\"id\":\"s45_3378\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vereesa Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Vereesa Windrunner says: The Silver Covenant was formed to oppose the Horde. Our enmity toward them could not be quelled.\",\"timestamp\":1776189767,\"id\":\"s45_3379\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vereesa Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Vereesa Windrunner says: Not when greater threats lurk outside our walls.\",\"timestamp\":1776189768,\"id\":\"s45_3380\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Archmage Aethas Sunreaver\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Archmage Aethas Sunreaver says: The Sunreavers sought to reclaim our place in the Kirin Tor. We never meant to become a political tool.\",\"timestamp\":1776189775,\"id\":\"s45_3381\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Madliß-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Madliß-Tichondrius:1449:GUILD:|h[|cff3fc7ebMadliß|r]|h: i need help im trying to figure out this sim thing to pick the best gear out of the vault im not sure how to read this tho\",\"timestamp\":1776189781,\"id\":\"s45_3382\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vereesa Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Vereesa Windrunner says: I agree to this compact, though I will never forgive the Horde for what it has done.\",\"timestamp\":1776189782,\"id\":\"s45_3383\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|T7639517:12|t|Hcurrency:3391:0|h[Adventurer Dawncrest]|h|rx10\",\"timestamp\":1776189782,\"id\":\"s45_3384\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Madliß-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Madliß-Tichondrius:1459:GUILD:|h[|cff3fc7ebMadliß|r]|h: https://www.raidbots.com/simbot/topgear\",\"timestamp\":1776189783,\"id\":\"s45_3385\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Archmage Aethas Sunreaver\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Archmage Aethas Sunreaver says: Let this flame remind us of our true calling: to share knowledge and power against a common foe.\",\"timestamp\":1776189785,\"id\":\"s45_3386\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Archmage Aethas Sunreaver\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Archmage Aethas Sunreaver says: As I will never forgive the Alliance for purging us from Dalaran. Yet I, too, agree to this compact.\",\"timestamp\":1776189788,\"id\":\"s45_3387\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: I trust--and hope--that things went well, Stormclout.\",\"timestamp\":1776189796,\"id\":\"s45_3388\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: We believe we can heal the Darkwell, and we would like you there when we do.\",\"timestamp\":1776189799,\"id\":\"s45_3389\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"Dwarf\",\"name\":\"Stormlad-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Stormlad-Tichondrius:1474:GUILD:|h[|cff0070ddStormlad|r]|h: what dont you understand\",\"timestamp\":1776189815,\"id\":\"s45_3390\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_BG_SYSTEM_NEUTRAL\",\"type\":\"BG_NEUTRAL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.4705882668495178,\"b\":0.03921568766236305},\"text\":\"Someone has indicated they are ready for the match to start!\",\"timestamp\":1776189829,\"id\":\"s45_3391\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Superjelly-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Superjelly-Tichondrius:1480:GUILD:|h[|cffa330c9Superjelly|r]|h: when you sim you just select the thing that includes great vault items\",\"timestamp\":1776189830,\"id\":\"s45_3392\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Superjelly-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Superjelly-Tichondrius:1481:GUILD:|h[|cffa330c9Superjelly|r]|h: assuming you opened your vault already\",\"timestamp\":1776189836,\"id\":\"s45_3393\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Madliß-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Madliß-Tichondrius:1482:GUILD:|h[|cff3fc7ebMadliß|r]|h: i guess what piece of gear would be the best to pick\",\"timestamp\":1776189840,\"id\":\"s45_3394\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_BG_SYSTEM_NEUTRAL\",\"type\":\"BG_NEUTRAL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.4705882668495178,\"b\":0.03921568766236305},\"text\":\"Thirty seconds until the Arena battle begins!\",\"timestamp\":1776189842,\"id\":\"s45_3395\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Stormclout-Tichondrius:1484:GUILD:|h[|cff00ff98Stormclout|r]|h: thats what raidbots is for\",\"timestamp\":1776189847,\"id\":\"s45_3396\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Stormclout-Tichondrius:1485:GUILD:|h[|cff00ff98Stormclout|r]|h: \\\"select all great vault items\\\" -> sim\",\"timestamp\":1776189855,\"id\":\"s45_3397\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_BG_SYSTEM_NEUTRAL\",\"type\":\"BG_NEUTRAL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.4705882668495178,\"b\":0.03921568766236305},\"text\":\"Fifteen seconds until the Arena battle begins!\",\"timestamp\":1776189857,\"id\":\"s45_3398\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"Dwarf\",\"name\":\"Stormlad-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Stormlad-Tichondrius:1487:GUILD:|h[|cff0070ddStormlad|r]|h: ^\",\"timestamp\":1776189859,\"id\":\"s45_3399\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_BG_SYSTEM_NEUTRAL\",\"type\":\"BG_NEUTRAL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.4705882668495178,\"b\":0.03921568766236305},\"text\":\"The Arena battle has begun!\",\"timestamp\":1776189872,\"id\":\"s45_3400\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"name\":\"Stormclout\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"timestamp\":1776190071,\"id\":\"s45_3401\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: The others have gathered gifts from their home to help with the Darkwell. Please let them know we are ready for them.\",\"timestamp\":1776190093,\"id\":\"s45_3402\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"First Arcanist Thalyssra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"First Arcanist Thalyssra says: The fruit of the Arcan'dor can cleanse all manner of magic. I'm certain it will do so here.\",\"timestamp\":1776190098,\"id\":\"s45_3403\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: I know this is no small thing you offer us. Silvermoon owes you a debt of gratitude.\",\"timestamp\":1776190100,\"id\":\"s45_3404\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vereesa Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Vereesa Windrunner says: Aethas and I have agreed to bring Anasterian's crown. A symbolic gesture befitting the last king of Silvermoon.\",\"timestamp\":1776190105,\"id\":\"s45_3405\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vereesa Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Vereesa Windrunner says: Are you sure about this, Aethas? The crown has only just been returned to its home.\",\"timestamp\":1776190107,\"id\":\"s45_3406\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: Trust me, Rommath. This shard will regulate the Void energies within the well.\",\"timestamp\":1776190111,\"id\":\"s45_3407\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: To allow the Void to remain at all... your calculations have to be perfect, Umbric.\",\"timestamp\":1776190113,\"id\":\"s45_3408\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"Scourge\",\"name\":\"Madliß-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Madliß-Tichondrius:1520:GUILD:|h[|cff3fc7ebMadliß|r]|h: oh i needed to pick the enchants that what the problem is\",\"timestamp\":1776190119,\"id\":\"s45_3409\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Shandris Feathermoon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Shandris Feathermoon says: We have brought the purifying waters of our moonwells. I hope it will help.\",\"timestamp\":1776190125,\"id\":\"s45_3410\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: Thank you for coming. I know this was not an easy decision.\",\"timestamp\":1776190126,\"id\":\"s45_3411\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Shandris Feathermoon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Shandris Feathermoon says: The right decision is seldom easy. A lesson that we must all take to heart.\",\"timestamp\":1776190131,\"id\":\"s45_3412\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: We stand here today because of you, champion. Let us put an end to this Darkwell.\",\"timestamp\":1776190144,\"id\":\"s45_3413\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|T7639517:12|t|Hcurrency:3391:0|h[Adventurer Dawncrest]|h|rx10\",\"timestamp\":1776190147,\"id\":\"s45_3414\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ4:|T7090843:12|t|Hitem:257143::::::::90:269::11::1:28:872:::::|h[Peridot Dragonhawk]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1776190184,\"id\":\"s45_3415\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|T7525984:12|t|Hitem:265106::::::::90:269::11::1:28:3313:::::|h[Farstriders' Pride Statue]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1776190184,\"id\":\"s45_3416\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Pandaren\",\"name\":\"Stormclout-Tichondrius\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You re